      "id": "claim_0044c167e671470d99ef38b8d8c11339",
      "statement": "useStore.js (~4400 lines) is the single source of truth for all project state: imported workbooks (elementTypes, psRows, recipes), position UI, tag system, dirty tracking (psChanges, rsChanges), undo history (past, future), and file-watch alerts.",
