      "id": "claim_74fd0303192340298cc1733ea63023c9",
      "statement": "Dirty tracking uses coalesced registries: psChanges (one entry per modified ElementTypeRef) and rsChanges (one entry per modified recipe row). Each entry carries changedFields (field-level patch for exported rows), before (stable base for diffing), and exported/batch markers for reconciliation.",
