      "id": "claim_1ce954e83cfc4300a983f0fea653ac98",
      "statement": "Conflict handling is triggered by file-watch alerts: when a workbook changes externally, checkFiles() re-reads the files and reconcileAll() detects conflicts by comparing pending fields against the workbook's current values. Users then choose 'keep-my-changes' (re-export) or 'take-file-value' (drop the field). No auto-merge occurs.",
